OL,3,GNEWSAInside the control room dealing
OL,4,Awith fires and floods
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In your most terrifying moments, the
OL,7,Fvoice of calm is the control room
OL,8,Fstaff."
OL,10,FThose are the words of Theresa Hurford,
OL,11,Fwho has been working in a fire service
OL,12,Fcontrol room in Shropshire for nearly
OL,13,F19 years - taking countless calls from
OL,14,Fthe public and deploying firefighters
OL,15,Facross the county.
OL,17,F"It's worth remembering when the blue
OL,18,Flights turn up - before that, there
OL,19,F[was] a voice at the end of the line,"
OL,20,Fshe said.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
