OL,3,GNEWSAInside the control room dealing
OL,4,Awith fires and floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer colleagues around the globe are
OL,7,Fbeing celebrated by International
OL,8,FControl Room Week, acknowledging the
OL,9,Fhard work of people who deal with
OL,10,Fcrises day in, day out.
